2. The following offences may be compounded by the Chief Licensing Officer or any authorised officer authorised in writing by the Chief Licensing Officer in accordance with section 42 of the Act:
(a)any offence under section 19(3) or 35(3)(a) or (b) of the Act;
(b)any offence under regulation 64(10) of the Early Childhood Development Centres Regulations 2018.
